sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant MQTT as MQTT / Shadow service
    participant Device
    Note over App,Device: R = $vc/devices/device-1/shadow/name/tutorial
    App->>MQTT: MQTT PUBLISH R/update (desired.power=on, version=7)
    MQTT-->>App: PUBACK (transport acknowledgement)
    alt Version accepted
        MQTT-->>App: R/update/accepted (patch, version=8)
        MQTT-->>Device: R/update/delta (state.power=on, version=8)
        MQTT-->>App: R/update/documents (previous/current, current.version=8)
        Note over App,Device: Notifications shown for subscribed clients, not cross-client ordering
        Device->>MQTT: MQTT PUBLISH R/update (reported.power=on)
        MQTT-->>Device: R/update/accepted
        App->>MQTT: MQTT PUBLISH R/get (clientToken=read-current)
        MQTT-->>App: R/get/accepted (full state, matching clientToken)
    else Stale version
        MQTT-->>App: R/update/rejected (code=409)
    end
